{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d552880f4a17e7e6dbacd2e29d7a44cf246318558e56a48e78d4f2b33f73d9fc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbb73cba6a4e4999fcdd42d87ce7935e1df2d524b4a436567d0c252196369821",
      "text": "只要和大家在一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a342f38ac49e2fa5d3fcf963219657ffd004b28a510ed9ad6c1cb7806b29ffda",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b936d7edf652543aa1fbb2d32a8e9e2ea53734367afea6cf2d2c489314c8340f",
      "text": "花音君，从试穿服装开始就心情很好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faff788ba62b1b3e4e0a5417e85427e52760542a6339d3781ef0bfdc11d5c3a6",
      "text": "嗯！因为这次演唱会的服装也超——级\n超——级可爱嘛♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:caf29cec48ae3edecfa01e8fd76081542b72809985d1b20d1343d41cc848c16f",
      "text": "转一圈就会飘起来的衬衫也是，\n带蝴蝶结的勋章也很时尚很棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbee332e11fc0a32c052b8ae823d3abbb117257c6aa345e4141f854cfe0f7157",
      "text": "本大爷也很中意那身衣服！\n真想早点站上舞台啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6a6bf75a25ed17a2a725c25cdf0b067a15d6505ec3a7f0ec48ef2c740512b76",
      "text": "嗯。能和事务所的大家穿同一套服装，\n我也非常开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28471f4d78fe134c925ebbeea4786fbccad8c7d2b4cbae3e085752f5e7384436",
      "text": "但是……一想到是那么大的舞台，\n心里就有点紧张心跳加速呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c50dd19e5046ea5d8ed65dce7fc190fd002d6cd55970a6f3f4b9a5eedebd8894",
      "text": "你这家伙还真是个胆小鬼啊～\n学学本大爷，沉着稳重一点！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fff1eb06f293885d6039bf6fb9d0ee9c5cf6530d8700c3345f9c49e8c19a57be",
      "text": "我们也一直在一起哦！\n穿着可爱的服装一起加油吧～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_012_22_5_06_012_22:5_06_012_22:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0267a56fa48991e68b035bd995260d1a7440b44d684c1645c348879c8d2031d9",
      "text": "嗯、嗯！\n演唱会，一定要大获成功……！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
